The tasks is a list of "A", "A", "A", "B", "B", and "B".
The gap is 2.
Keep a shared run as 0.
Keep a shared biggest as 0.
Keep a shared leaders as 0.
The joined is join tasks with "".
The order is sort characters of joined.
The last is the last position of order.
The symbol is the slice of order from 0 to 1.
Set run to 1.
To finish.
If run is more than biggest, set biggest to run, set leaders to 1, return.
If run is biggest, add 1 to leaders.

For every spot from 1 to last.
The piece is the slice of order from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches symbol, add 1 to run, otherwise Finish, set symbol to piece, set run to 1.

Finish.
The spread is (biggest minus 1) times (gap plus 1) plus leaders.
The final is the last position of tasks.
The total is final plus 1.
If spread is less than total, show total, otherwise show spread.
